<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns both secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns both secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico completed both credit auctions in which it sought to inject 3.179 billion pesos in the secondary market.</p>
<p>    CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    1.179  bln pesos  6 days   31.44  pct</p>
<p>    2.000  bln pesos  1 day    31.15  pct</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
